WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,308
You spin me right round, Kony, right round, like a record, Kony, right round, round, round.

2
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:11,570
Oh, what a week on the wheel of fortune!

3
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:15,204
It's the second-best thing to happen to Lester this week.

4
00:00:15,204 --> 00:00:19,689
Back from the dead, he's backed the right United two weeks in a row.

5
00:00:19,689 --> 00:00:25,707
Dumb and Dumber—sorry, PIG and Bryan—ended up with a fast pass for the wheel this week.

6
00:00:25,707 --> 00:00:30,088
PIG got all snouty; not even the rulebook could calm his oinking.

7
00:00:30,088 --> 00:00:34,676
But the wheel doesn't lie, and neither does Kony three-six-five.

8
00:00:34,676 --> 00:00:41,132
The Black Cats landed both of them in the next round, with Infankony giving the lads the Argentina treatment.

9
00:00:41,132 --> 00:00:45,642
The wheel did seem to claim one victim this week: Brad's honeymoon.

10
00:00:45,642 --> 00:00:48,155
Anyway, back to the game.

11
00:00:48,155 --> 00:00:53,258
Ten of the twenty players are now six feet deep after Liverpool drew with Forest.

12
00:00:53,258 --> 00:00:57,318
Isak's stepovers are giving me Ali Dia for Southampton.

13
00:00:57,318 --> 00:00:59,934
Let's hope he finds his feet...

14
00:00:59,934 --> 00:01:01,351
Naaaaaaaaaaaaaaat.

15
00:01:01,351 --> 00:01:08,052
Anyway, another one hundred and sixty million dollars spent in response should do the trick for Net Spend F.C.

16
00:01:08,052 --> 00:01:11,815
The last player out was our favourite doctor, Hub.

17
00:01:11,815 --> 00:01:17,176
He put his chips on an underdog in week one, and then on total dog shit this week.

18
00:01:17,176 --> 00:01:18,903
Ten down.

19
00:01:18,903 --> 00:01:20,617
Ten to go.

20
00:01:20,617 --> 00:01:23,426
See you next time, fellas.

21
00:01:23,426 --> 00:01:25,617
Have a wheelie good week.
